Description: Fix CVE-2025-8916 - cap SubjectAltName size in PKIXCertPathReviewer
 PKIXCertPathReviewer lacked a limit on Subject Alternative Name entries
 processed during name-constraint checks, enabling DoS via oversized SAN
 extensions. Adds NAME_CHECK_MAX (1024) to both the pkix jcajce and
 deprecated prov x509 reviewers, matching upstream. Includes the clarifying
 comment in RFC3280CertPathUtilities from the upstream follow-up commit.
 Uses createErrorBundle() in the pkix reviewer (API present since 1.78).
